{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0354_1000_022ser", "source_sha256": "5e317a4f104b5228fdb3e35abb8aa8c7e0a29c6c0b92c9b15fa7f13fe755fbae", "ja": "悪魔よりも、力がない……とかなのかな？\n他にはどんなところが違うんだろう……？", "zh": "难道是……比恶魔还要弱之类的？\n除此之外，还有哪些地方不一样呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0354_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8676d9b832bea26a85ede437530f24fc9aa5724c8d8c546b068cce6e47f31c2d", "ja": "お疲れ様、星梨花。\nどうした？　なんだか難しい顔してるけど……。", "zh": "辛苦了，星梨花。\n怎么了？你好像一副很苦恼的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0354_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "e223b7b4c40ce681f953b850e28290a6be32e648928e993c011737ada70358eb", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\n実は今、小悪魔について考えてたんです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！其实，我刚才正在思考小恶魔的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0354_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "c96021eddad4dc130db5c8a6d6741c3f90c6e68597f8e51f2ef62a5769744e29", "ja": "小悪魔って、小さい悪魔のことをいうんですよね？\n悪魔より力も体も小さいだけなのかなって。", "zh": "小恶魔，是指小小的恶魔对吧？\n我在想，是不是只是力量和体型都比恶魔小而已呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0354_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "68524e8623a20bb823a23c52b074dc1c020516404f2dc8f67e3a14bff6264b13", "ja": "もっと違うところがあるんでしょうか？\n{$P$}さん、教えてください！", "zh": "还有别的不一样的地方吗？\n{$P$}先生，请告诉我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0354_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a6b2c1a8942955738383fe040e53d81dd3402551533efcb2a929156e199e75c2", "ja": "そ、そうだな……。知ってる範囲になるけど、小悪魔は\n人間を魅了したり、いたずらっ子なイメージかな。", "zh": "嗯、这个嘛……虽然只限于我知道的范围，小恶魔给人的印象就是会魅惑人类，或者喜欢恶作剧吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0354_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "8586cc12fec04fec07864e41755cd989eced0c575a481489fb50163adf1aa120", "ja": "いたずらですか？　じゃあわたしもイタズラしたら、\nこの衣装が似合う小悪魔になれますか？", "zh": "恶作剧吗？那我也恶作剧的话，就能变成适合穿这身服装的小恶魔了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0354_1007_p", "source_sha256": "94c0382871085e8ad8b91ccd258fae20f868e631559a0fe5082c5e3f4a1b2e4e", "ja": "え！？　い、いや、イタズラなんてしなくても\n衣装、よく似合ってるぞ！", "zh": "诶！？不、不是说要恶作剧，就算不恶作剧，这身服装也很适合你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0354_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "b66744a60ef8d56c8944523f70943ff06254a02fa43ed33eb1ae13868d1d0b2f", "ja": "本当ですか！　えへへ、うれしいです♪\nあっ、でもどうしよう……。", "zh": "真的吗！　嘿嘿，好开心♪\n啊，可是该怎么办呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0354_1009_p", "source_sha256": "502003443ef1e25eedf698b3ae03c969903cbdb988387ea54de88caa857475e8", "ja": "ん？　どうした？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0354_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "10dff6ab41bea765740cc292c850af7be47a5b7113b008d422355d0aedc4a960", "ja": "いえ、なんでもなくて。{$P$}さん！\nあんなところにジュニオールが！？", "zh": "没什么，没事。{$P$}先生！\n小朱尼奥尔怎么会在那种地方！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0354_1011_p", "source_sha256": "472e713510ebb696befd91ac7059ff8d314729d2dadf75fd126c51f369b6211e", "ja": "えっ？\n星梨花、今日ジュニオールを連れてきたのか？", "zh": "诶？\n星梨花，你今天把朱尼奥尔带来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0354_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "337b1e040579d8878bb8d3abd8d40e2d28644af57f681f48470f93cc4d8d711e", "ja": "えっ！？　えっと……それは……。", "zh": "诶！？　那个……这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0354_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "66d6145907f82a2a19a164f3906bd95ac17adc14c0350c0b0a4bb7f40f76d17b", "ja": "と、とにかく、{$P$}さん！\nジュニオールがいるんです。だから、見てください！", "zh": "总、总之，{$P$}先生！它就在这里。所以，请您看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0354_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e3c591ab9330de3ac5adc03534bbb79655af8a04c1603671296f9eb33cbe7970", "ja": "（うーん、これは明らかに嘘だ……。\nでも、星梨花には何か考えがあるのかもしれないな）", "zh": "（嗯，这明显是在撒谎……不过，星梨花或许有什么打算吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0354_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a3c8b94dce8368aa32625d94886ff36e64626c2c89cd818aa99763e454ce258a", "ja": "わ、わかった！\n星梨花がそこまで言うなら……チラッ。", "zh": "我、我知道了！\n既然星梨花都说到这个份上了……（偷瞄）。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0354_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "75eb1c5beafbadac494a6e7a5e9ea6e8515f47f03cf7105b9967833af470452b", "ja": "えいっ！", "zh": "嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0354_1017_null", "source_sha256": "34f8d5e47fce531e822718654cb7aa6cb086e91f9048fcf94639fd666bcaf8a7", "ja": "ポスッ！", "zh": "噗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0354_1018_p", "source_sha256": "03b9c38ee278f9b7ced460353873aa997cb80541164a4e835cc4a392951ce3d7", "ja": "！？　ポケットに何か入ったような……。\nん？　これは、チョコレート？", "zh": "！？好像有什么东西放进了口袋里……嗯？这是巧克力？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0354_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "5bd2f6239e65f7ebcc239b737f5a1606eee9290d8e2b144695280f0580a26bab", "ja": "はい！　今日はハロウィンですから♪\nこういういたずらじゃ、小悪魔にはなれませんか？", "zh": "是的！今天可是万圣节♪\n像这样的恶作剧，还不能算是小恶魔吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0354_1020_p", "source_sha256": "d9e024e0f736a6b7aa846eb91b9177bc33e1ce485d2ccc89130891b43bb8a350", "ja": "そんなことないよ。人を幸せにする素敵ないたずらだ。\n星梨花は、ちゃんと小悪魔になれてるよ。", "zh": "才不是那样。这可是能让人幸福的美妙恶作剧。\n星梨花已经成功成为小恶魔了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0354_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "5429de9b771c331b52a98f05ffbdd8a366d91a31e9f779f5245d5adead061bd2", "ja": "人を幸せにするいたずら……。えへへ。", "zh": "能让人幸福的恶作剧……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0354_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "b4b770660233a0bf9a3bfa61a915592c4d15167b6e1b47045ca4888f1235375f", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}さん！\nわたし、もっともっと小悪魔になれるよう頑張ります♪", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}先生！\n我会努力变得更加更加像个小恶魔的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0354_1023_p", "source_sha256": "5796873d81b1aa083ae4f25e24b86bfc170a2c8402620333b99702e37a80a853", "ja": "（星梨花なら、多くの人を幸せにするいたずらが\nできそうだ。さて、チョコを食べて休憩でもするか！）", "zh": "（如果是星梨花的话，应该能做出让很多人都感到幸福的恶作剧吧。好了，吃点巧克力休息一下吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
